  "description": "Compress, optimize and edit PDF files in .NET. Pure C#, MIT licensed, no native binaries and no Ghostscript. Lossless PDF compression (object streams, compressed xref streams, deduplication, Flate recompression, lossless JPEG re-encoding) with a built-in equivalence proof on every output, plus opt-in JPEG quality reduction. Merge, split, reorder, rotate and import pages, edit metadata and bookmarks, encrypt and decrypt with AES-256, AES-128 and RC4. No dependencies on .NET 8 and later; .NET Standard 2.0 for .NET Framework 4.6.2+. Native AOT compatible. By Jamal Abdelkhalek, JADEV.",
